{
  "origin": "the triage raise is an opener, never a case: a rerouted concern puts the user in front of the problem in the product's terms, names the rerouting topic once the situation is on the page, states a position with one load-bearing reason, and says where the ball sits — the entry's depth (itemised costs, tuning numbers, the rejected alternative) stays back until the conversation asks and lands at the fold. The drift this guards is the wall: an exhaustive entry surfaced whole — every option costed, every number carried, the position with its derivation — leaving the user asking to be told what is actually being suggested. The entry is fixture-authored rich on purpose, so what the raise omits is checkable against what the entry holds",
